# Optional: URL of a server-side proxy that calls your LLM provider.
# Leave unset to use the built-in mock AI. Never put provider API keys in VITE_ variables.
# The endpoint receives POST { task, system, input, response_format: "json" } and must return
# JSON matching the schema in src/services/ai/prompts.ts for that task.
VITE_AI_ENDPOINT=
